n #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pyapi[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pyapi: carry the structured note list through the Python `Issue` model, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSONL codec, SQLite mirror, and every read-only consumer via [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`notes_text`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]NOTES rendering in `sase bead show`[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]show[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pyapi[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]show: add the shared note presentation module and render one dated, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attributed, ordinal-addressed block per note in `sase bead show`, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ACE bead detail pane, and the detail/query JSON payloads.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Append-only write surface[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pyapi[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: retire `sase bead update --notes` behind a teaching error and add a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batch `sase bead update --note` append that mirrors `sase bead close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--note`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Note edit and retraction[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]repair[dim] · [dim][/dim]after show, cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair: add `sase bead note --edit` and `--remove` with their own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]events, an `edited` render marker, and drop the clobbering Notes field [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from the ACE bead editor modal.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after repair[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: update the bead docs, the CLI reference tables, and the sase_beads[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory note to describe the append-only timestamped note log.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-t2","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-t2.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-3fb61feda24ab238f030f381d68226f9","started_at":"2026-08-24T18:39:58.117644+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"21901920d04dee915be0a5e5c18d1014e514552ec352465be29c963f72154ea4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-t2.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"4b38cc6f1dbd1ee941b2d90c979c9b872a840ffe82b0d760a2265eb36b3d40dc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-t2.5/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"e7b633437a9bfd99f5e7e46ba91556f892fddaa7b81f9b7edd424ee81437cfdd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-t2.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":170},"state":{"digest":"4360884d21b87f1e903c086d2c4bd94457ef1529399cea31be641f202c212b61","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-t2.5/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-t2.5","local_name":"sase-t2.5","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-t2","agent_clan_generation":"20260824143909","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-t2.5","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-t2","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-t2.5","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4487522e8851c8f815b33375f2337ee0","started_at":"20260824143913","state":"waiting"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"07349e573903